	Diffuse radiation [W/m**2] (DIF) * PI: Fabbri, Bryan (bryan.e.fabbri@nasa.gov) * METHOD/DEVICE: Pyranometer, Kipp & Zonen, CM21, SN 041282, WRMC No. 78003
